      "content": "hey so i was working in the garden and i accidentally stepped on an old rusty trowel. it's a pretty deep puncture in my foot. im kinda worried about it getting infected but im so busy with work right now i cant really go to a clinic today. whats the best way to clean it out and seal it up so it doesnt get nasty??",
